# Output from the designlang / design-extract tool. It writes here by default
# when run from the repo root, and its artifacts capture page *content* (copy,
# prices, contact details) — not just styles. Kept out of git so an extraction
# of any signed-in view can never be swept in by a routine `git add .`.
design-extract-output/
